001100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
001200 PROGRAM-ID.          TLABELS.
001300 AUTHOR.              C HILLES.
001400 DATE-WRITTEN.        OCTOBER, 1982.
001500 DATE-COMPILED.
001600*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
001700*REMARKS.             USAGE REPORT.
001800*
001900*    ON NOVEMBER 8, 1984, CHANGED THIS PROGRAM TO USE
002000*    "MSTORERM-LIST" WITH ONLY ITEMS NEEDED FROM THE MSTORERM
002100*    DATA SET, RATHER THAN "ALL-ITEM-LIST".  THIS IS SO THAT
002200*    I CAN PULL CORPORATE CODES FOR A NEW PLANT ONTO THE HP
002300*    SYSTEM, AND USE A SPECIAL DATABASE WITH ONLY THOSE FIELDS
002400*    IN MSTORERM THAT ARE NEEDED FOR LABELS.  THEN THIS LABEL
002500*    PROGRAM WILL BE ABLE TO RUN AGAINST THIS SPECIAL DATABASE.
002600*    CIH.
002700*
002800*    ON FEB 5, 1985, TOOK OUT THE DBGET OF MPLTINFO KEY "P 01",
002900*    BECAUSE THE REDUCED LABEL DATABASE DID NOT HAVE THIS DATA
003000*    SET, AND BECAUSE THE MPLTINFO DATA WAS NOT USED IN THE
003100*    PROGRAM.  CIH.
003200*
003300*      JUNE 10, 1986                C.R. KALMAN
003400*         1. HARD-CODED ESCAPE SEQUENCES REMOVED FROM
003500*            PROGRAM.  THEY ARE NOW TO BE EXTERNALLY
003600*            SUPPLIED.
003700*         2. THE MAIN PROGRAM IN A JOB STREAM WILL
003800*            COPY ESC-NAM2 THAT CONTAINS THE HP
003900*            ESCAPE SEQUENCES.  IT WILL ALSO CALL
004000*            TESCSEQ THAT CONTAINS THE NON-HP ESCAPE
004100*            SEQUENCES, IF ANY ARE USED.  THE NON-HP
004200*            SEQUENCES WILL OVERRIDE THE HP SEQUENCES.
004300*         3. THE ACTUAL PRINTING PROGRAM WILL GET THE
004400*            APPROPRIATE SEQUENCES PASSED DOWN TO IT
004500*            THRU THE INTERMEDIATE SUBROUTINES THAT
004600*            COPY ESC-NAME.
004610*
004700*       ON MARCH 23,1987  PROGRAM NO LONGER READS RLFILE.
004710*       RLFILE DOES NOT EXIST ANYMORE. THE PROGRAM WAS CHANGED
004720*       TO COBOL ACCEPT THE PRINT OPTIONS FROM THE TEMPORARY
004730*       STREAM FILE 'BLABJOB'.
004740*       THIS STREAM FILE WAS CREATED AND STREAMED FROM THE PRE-
004750*       PROCESSING PROGRAM 'TRLMODE'.
004760*       ADDED TO THE PROGRAM IS THE PROCESSING FOR PRINTING OF
004770*       INDIVIDUAL CORP CODES. THE PROGRAM NOW ALLOWS USERS TO
004780*       PRINT LABELS FOR SELECTED CORP-CODES.
005500*       ADDED CALL TO 'CDESC' TO GET 4 LINES OF DESCRIPTION
005600*                                  CJR.
      *C  06/12/96   JEFF BUNGO
      *C    EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C    RECOMPILE TO PICK UP NEW FILE FORMATS.
      *C
      *C  11/25/97    JEFF BUNGO   REQ #97-017
      *C     ADD USAGE FIELDS FOR DIRECT DELIVERY.  DD USAGE
      *C     TO BE STORED IN ADDITIONAL FIELD AND TOTAL USAGE.
      *C     STORE ISSUE USAGE CALCULATED BY TOTAL USAGE - DD USAGE.
      *C
      *C  03/01/01    CA YODER
      *C     ADDED OPTION TO PRINT ONLY CODE AND K/M ON THE LABELS
      *C     AS WELL AS THE NUMBER OF THESE LABELS TO PRINT PER CODE.
      *C
      *C  03/29/01    CA YODER    LAWTON REQUEST
      *C     ADDED BIN LOCATION TO K/M LABELS.
      *C
      *C  05/12/04    CA YODER    J THOMAS REQUEST
      *C     ADDED NEW OPTION FOR 2" X 6" LABELS.
      *C
005700*
005800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
