071100**   NOTE THAT THE "SPOOL2631STRT2" SUBROUTINE IS USED      **
071200**   INSTEAD OF "SPOOL2631START".  THE "STRT2" ALLOWS US    **
071300**   TO SPECIFY A FILE LIMIT FOR THE SPOOL-FILE, WHICH      **
071400**   NORMALLY HAS A LIMIT OF 5000 RECORDS.  SINCE THIS      **
071500**   REPORT COULD PRINT OVER 5000 RECORDS, WE USE "STRT2"   **
071600**   TO SPECIFY A HIGHER LIMIT (40,000 RECORDS).            **
